    </header>

    <main class="shell bcc-page">
      <section class="bcc-hero">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">
            <span class="landscape-copy">Faith · Community · Service</span>
            <span class="portrait-copy">Glaube · Gemeinschaft · Dienst</span>
          </p>
          <h1>
            <span class="landscape-copy">Active in DCG Waltrop.</span>
            <span class="portrait-copy">Aktiv in der DCG Waltrop.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="intro landscape-copy">
            Faith and church community are an important part of my life—locally
            at DCG Waltrop and in the wider international fellowship of BCC
            (called DCG in Germany).
          </p>
          <p class="intro portrait-copy">
            Glaube und Gemeindeleben sind ein wichtiger Teil meines Lebens – vor
            Ort in der DCG Waltrop und in der internationalen Gemeinschaft von
            BCC.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bcc-monogram" aria-hidden="true">
          BCC
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="bcc-panels">
        <section
          id="bcc-dcg"
          class="bcc-panel bcc-dcg-panel"
          aria-labelledby="dcg-waltrop-title"
        >
          <div class="dcg-panel-head">
            <div>
